            "en": "AI has substituted for knowledge storage (it knows more than anyone), memory (it retrieves instantly), fluent expression (it writes better than most), skill through practice (it doesn’t tire, doesn’t slip, doesn’t need reps).",
            "cn": "因为 AI 替代了知识储备（它知道的比任何人多），替代了记忆力（它能随时调取），替代了流畅表达（它写得比大部分人好），替代了熟练度（它不疲劳、不出错、不需要练习）。"
