            "en": "AI can force “A is like B” into “a specific mechanism in A is isomorphic to a specific mechanism in B.” That forcing is itself cognitive improvement.",
            "cn": "AI 会逼你从“A 像 B”精炼到“A 的某个具体机制和 B 的某个具体机制同构”。这个逼迫本身就是思维的提升。"
